# Allowlist: the image build only needs the Go module, its sources, the
# Lua scripts and the game data. Everything else (.git, plan/, L2J_Mobius/,
# docs, local files) stays out. Docker does not read .gitignore, so data/
# brings the git-ignored data/html (NPC dialog pages from `make data`) when
# it exists.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!scripts
!data
